  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nElected Officials in Cedar County, Iowa\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Skip to content\n \n\n \n\n Cedar County, Iowa\n Elections\n \n \n\n \n\n \n \nVote\n \n \nRegister to Vote\n \nAbsentee Voting\n \nMaps\n \nMilitary/Overseas Voting\n \nPrecincts\n \nVoter ID\n \n \n \nElections\n \n \nUpcoming Elections\n \nPast Elections\n \nSample Ballots\n \nPrecinct Election Officials\n \nTypes of Elections\n \n \n \nElected Officials\n \n \nFederal\n \nState\n \nCounty\n \nCity\n \nSchool Board\n \nTownship\n \n \n \nCandidates\n \nNews\n \nFAQ\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nElected Officials\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nElected Officials\n\n \nFederal\n \nState\n \nCity\n \nCounty\n \nSchool Board\n \nTownship\n\n \n\n \n\n \nFrom the White House to the Courthouse, we've compiled a list of elected officials who represent the citizens of Cedar County, Iowa. View by category from any device using the links below.\n \n \n\n \nFederal Officials\n White House, U.S. Senate, and U.S. House\n \n \n\n \nState Representatives\n \nGovernor, State Officers, Senate, and House\n \n \n\n \nCountywide Officials\n including Soil and Water and Agricultural Extension commissioners\n \n \n\n \nCity Representatives\n Mayor and Council members, plus City Clerks in each Cedar County community\n \n \n\n \nSchool Board Representatives\n School board members along with district administration information\n \n \n\n \nTownship Representatives\n Trustees and clerks for each Cedar County township\n \n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n Cedar County Auditor\n\n Cedar County Courthouse\n \n400 Cedar Street\n \nTipton, IA 52772\n\n Contact Us\n\n Accessibility\n\n \n \nOffice Hours\n\n 8:00AM to 4:00PM\n \nMonday - Friday \n \nPhone Numbers\n\n Office: (563) 886-3168\n \nFax: (563) 866-3339 \n \n\n \n\n Contact Cedar County Elections\n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \npowered by \n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
}
